{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/ytg7ypg7","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":1595.55,"top":46.84,"width":268.85,"height":122.33},"name":"Google Shape;122;p16","geometry":"custom","lineWidth":0}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/je9oruhs","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":288,"top":52.8,"width":1344,"height":96},"name":"Google Shape;123;p16","text":"Problem and existing workarounds","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":72,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#FFFFFF","bold":true,"alignment":"center"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wrypwzy1","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":235.2,"width":998.4,"height":246.4},"name":"Google Shape;124;p16","text":"WHO HAS THIS PROBLEM\nPatients and family caregivers managing the move from hospital to home.","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#171717","lineColor":"#333333","lineWidth":1.33,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7ED957","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xs76p4zm","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":510.4,"width":998.4,"height":246.4},"name":"Google Shape;125;p16","text":"HOW OFTEN IT HAPPENS\nAt each discharge, across pages of instructions and several follow-up tasks.","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#171717","lineColor":"#333333","lineWidth":1.33,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7ED957","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/apg7upgb","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":785.6,"width":998.4,"height":246.4},"name":"Google Shape;126;p16","text":"WHAT IT COSTS THEM TODAY\nTime spent searching and cross-checking. Uncertainty can delay a question or routine next step.","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#171717","lineColor":"#333333","lineWidth":1.33,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7ED957","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/bqponuhg","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":1084.8,"top":235.2,"width":777.6,"height":384},"name":"Google Shape;127;p16","text":"WHAT EXISTS TODAY\nPaper discharge packet\nMedication list\nPhone call to clinic or pharmacist\nPersonal notes and calendar","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#171717","lineColor":"#333333","lineWidth":1.33,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7ED957","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/onypsfy5","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":1084.8,"top":648,"width":777.6,"height":384},"name":"Google Shape;128;p16","text":"WHERE THEY FALL SHORT\nInformation is spread across documents and tools.\nUnclear or conflicting instructions still need a person to resolve them.","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#171717","lineColor":"#333333","lineWidth":1.33,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7ED957","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/jyx0ra1s","slideIndex":3,"text":""}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/i107q5of","slideIndex":4,"layout":{"id":"ly/ux4ruhcv","name":"BLANK"},"title":"How ClearCare works","textShapes":5,"backgroundColor":"rgba(0,0,0,1)"}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/8fql0rux","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":43.74,"top":26.42,"width":177.56,"height":190.66},"name":"Google Shape;133;p17","geometry":"custom","lineWidth":0}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/zahkn2dg","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":1595.55,"top":46.84,"width":268.85,"height":122.33},"name":"Google Shape;134;p17","geometry":"custom","lineWidth":0}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/y983uxcv","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":288,"top":52.8,"width":1344,"height":96},"name":"Google Shape;135;p17","text":"How ClearCare works","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":72,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#FFFFFF","bold":true,"alignment":"center"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lcz2pcvm","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":235.2,"width":888,"height":384},"name":"Google Shape;136;p17","text":"WHAT OUR AGENT DOES\nReads text PDFs locally and extracts instructions with source evidence.\nExplains the original wording in plain language.\nKeeps unclear or high-risk items in review.","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#171717","lineColor":"#333333","lineWidth":1.33,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7ED957","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kbqlw7u1","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":974.4,"top":235.2,"width":888,"height":384},"name":"Google Shape;137;p17","text":"HOW THE AGENT DECIDES\nDeterministic rules organize and validate document facts. A user click triggers a bounded Care Agent to retrieve relevant evidence and make one AMD request.\n","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#171717","lineColor":"#333333","lineWidth":1.33,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7ED957","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/j614z6dk","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":648,"width":888,"height":384},"name":"Google Shape;138;p17","text":"HOW IT HANDLES FAILURE\nMissing units, conflicts, unreadable text, or failed checks remain incomplete or need review. Nothing is silently repaired or auto-retried.\n","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#171717","lineColor":"#333333","lineWidth":1.33,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7ED957","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/i5s361cz","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":974.4,"top":648,"width":888,"height":384},"name":"Google Shape;139;p17","text":"WHY AGENTIC AND NOT A SIMPLE APP\nA question may need evidence from more than one place. The Care Agent selects document or calendar evidence, then returns a grounded answer with sources. Parsing and calendar rules stay deterministic.\n","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#171717","lineColor":"#333333","lineWidth":1.33,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7ED957","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/i107q5of","slideIndex":4,"text":""}
