{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gzq1g32h","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":235.2,"width":888,"height":384},"name":"Google Shape;164;p20","text":"CAN THIS BE BUILT FOR REAL?\nRuns locally for text PDFs. AMD explanations and Care Agent answers need a backend key and network. Scanned PDFs need optional local OCR.","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#171717","lineColor":"#333333","lineWidth":1.33,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7ED957","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/10j298j2","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":974.4,"top":235.2,"width":888,"height":384},"name":"Google Shape;165;p20","text":"WHO USES IT, WHAT CHANGES\nPatients and family caregivers get one source-linked checklist and clearer questions to take to their care team.","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#171717","lineColor":"#333333","lineWidth":1.33,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7ED957","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ed8jetkr","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":648,"width":888,"height":384},"name":"Google Shape;166;p20","text":"WHAT DIDN'T WORK\nBroad OCR and automatic whole-site translation remain outside this MVP. No caregiver comprehension study has been run.","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#171717","lineColor":"#333333","lineWidth":1.33,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7ED957","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/feh07y1w","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":974.4,"top":648,"width":888,"height":384},"name":"Google Shape;167;p20","text":"NEXT 30 DAYS\nRun caregiver comprehension sessions.\nAsk clinicians to review safety language.\nImprove scan support and evaluate more held-out documents.","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#171717","lineColor":"#333333","lineWidth":1.33,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7ED957","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
