{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ep4fytg7","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":57.6,"top":235.2,"width":1804.79,"height":796.79},"name":"Google Shape;175;p21","text":"SYNTHETIC EVALUATION\n110/110 extraction checks passed across 11 synthetic documents, with 0 clinically significant errors recorded. The held-out set passed 32/32 checks. Calendar checks placed 7/7 dated visits correctly, kept 4/4 undated visits off calendar, and created 0 invented visits. These small, hand-written tests do not establish clinical safety or patient comprehension.","geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#171717","lineColor":"#333333","lineWidth":1.33,"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7ED957","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
